// Q-072 `quillo check` passes a `service` option the loader refuses (`{ timout: "2s" }`): the program then does not start
// mode: check
// open-when: ok (1 routes
// fixed-when: no option `timout`
// From FEEDBACK9.md §Q-072 (found on 2ad2502). `quillo run` says: service billing: no option `timout` (timeout, retries, failures, cooldown).

service billing = "billing.qwe" { timout: "2s" }

route GET / = `${billing.total() ?? 0}`
